## Assumptions

Every one needs an owner, a confirm-by date, and **what breaks if it is wrong** — that last field is what turns an assumption into a managed risk rather than a permanent guess.

| Req id | Assumption (stated positively) | Owner | Confirm by | What breaks if wrong |
|---|---|---|---|---|

Mirror every open assumption into `../engagement-management/raid-log.md`.

## Chain audit

Derived at derive time — **do not maintain by hand.** The audit computes: unsourced requirements, orphan evidence, dangling `Source` citations, stale `UNVERIFIED`, and unowned assumptions. Counts render on the dashboard.
